NAME
    gcloud container workload - manage Workload Optimizer related workloads for
        GKE

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud container workload GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Workload Optimizer related workloads for GKE.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     profiles
        Quickstart engine for GKE workload optimization.
